# Project rules

- Before **adding** or **editing** tests, read and follow
  [`test-steps.mdc`](./test-steps.mdc).
- Before **creating** or **editing** a task in `docs/tasks/`, read and
  follow [`task-writing.mdc`](./task-writing.mdc). Create a new task only by
  running `python docs/tasks/create_task.py`.
- Never edit a closed task in `docs/tasks/closed/`. Closed tasks are
  immutable. Do not update them as a side effect of other work.
